# Netlify URL Rewrite Rules
# Maps clean /u/:slug URLs to the public-portfolio.html page
# The 200 status means a rewrite (not a redirect) — the browser URL stays clean

/u/:slug  /public-portfolio.html?u=:slug  200

# Catch-all: send any other unmatched paths to the index (SPA-style fallback)
# Uncomment the line below if you want a 404-friendly fallback:
# /*  /index.html  200
